  "body": "Hello :wave:\n\n:rocket::rocket::rocket:\n\n[eslint-plugin-react](https://www.npmjs.com/package/eslint-plugin-react) just published its new version 4.2.3, which **is not covered by your current version range**.\n\nIf this pull request passes your tests you can publish your software with the latest version of eslint-plugin-react – otherwise use this branch to work on adaptions and fixes.\n\nHappy fixing and merging :palm_tree:\n\n---\n\n[GitHub Release](https://github.com/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/releases/tag/v4.2.3)\n\n<h3>Fixed</h3>\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Fix class properties retrieval in <code>prefer-stateless-function</code> (<a href=\"http://urls.greenkeeper.io/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/issues/499\">#499</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n\n---\n\nThe new version differs by 108 commits .\n- [`3365231`](https://github.com/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/commit/33652317e7f1e96ad0b2377a4bad7d33354038b4) `Update CHANGELOG and bump version`\n- [`7fd3375`](https://github.com/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/commit/7fd3375217ee70fe15ff40d39f5fae1ca98c9cd4) `Fix class properties retrieval in prefer-stateless-function (fixes #499)`\n- [`f24d0cb`](https://github.com/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/commit/f24d0cba38f25d1ed5149f7e073064a634a15f86) `Update CHANGELOG and bump version`\n- [`dfe9fce`](https://github.com/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/commit/dfe9fce2830bbc6a549e9c3a8eb70dc74f32ed48) `Update dependencies`\n- [`ede5af0`](https://github.com/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/commit/ede5af01393667db8f5194903fa429555e5d8d3e) `Update prefer-stateless-function documentation`\n- [`37fc544`](https://github.com/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/commit/37fc544aa87400300d870dfaa78fb6ba06861b1d) `Fix this usage in jsx-no-undef (fixes #489)`\n- [`259fab4`](https://github.com/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/commit/259fab4ed1cb6299eb7059b90c995684a0a4baed) `Fix annotated function detection (fixes #498)`\n- [`2884a80`](https://github.com/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/commit/2884a80513972f6604fd09ae491744a80e01df7e) `Fix detection for direct props in prop-types (fixes #497)`\n- [`e83079d`](https://github.com/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/commit/e83079d82d9852b778ec1b89eb880b93b8b22722) `Add additional test for self-closing-comp`\n- [`226be21`](https://github.com/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/commit/226be211a73f7ebc9c730fec3ff3f4ce42af87f7) `Fix self-closing-comp to treat non-breaking spaces as content (fixes #496)`\n- [`cfca370`](https://github.com/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/commit/cfca370a5d4de6a8a647402c8491e7b6a74c37b6) `Rewrite prefer-stateless-function rule (fixes #491)`\n- [`426b228`](https://github.com/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/commit/426b22890452550ac978e66f2f22a0016dc41788) `Add shared setting for React version`\n- [`2226204`](https://github.com/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/commit/2226204ae35e47bc8d3a37fac55dc31d71868e9c) `Update CHANGELOG and bump version`\n- [`17f105c`](https://github.com/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/commit/17f105c9d4c4413b3bf9d0f058ae4e24b94c8da5) `Fix missing getChildContext lifecycle method in prefer-stateless-function (fixes #492)`\n- [`ad52cb2`](https://github.com/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/commit/ad52cb2f791e88fa14131935745dfa891b82a1bb) `Update jsx-sort-props documentation`\n\nThere are 108 commits in total. See the [full diff](https://github.com/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/compare/1371c76c05c090e195695b2c58aed8ea3ba1273b...33652317e7f1e96ad0b2377a4bad7d33354038b4).\n\n---\n\nThis pull request was created by [greenkeeper.io](http://greenkeeper.io/).\nIt keeps your software, up to date, all the time.\n\n<sub>\nTired of seeing this sponsor message? Upgrade to the supporter plan!\nYou'll also get your pull requests faster :zap:\n</sub>\n",
